      "desc:8": "Other people have missiles too. A radar watches every missile in flight and flags the ones that will land inside its protected radius, which you set on its screen (64 blocks to begin with).\n\nThe radar is a small 3 by 3 build of Radar Casing, two high, with one casing on top for the dish. The Assembler makes the casing four at a time at HV from 6 stainless steel plates. The HV controller sees 128 blocks and the EV controller 256, at any height; put an Energy Hatch of its tier and a Maintenance Hatch in the base. Its redstone output on every side is the number of incoming missiles, up to 15. Right-click the controller with a data stick to save its link for a battery. Build a radar.",
